@startuml UC11_MatchHistory_Activity
title UC11 - Match History (Activity Diagram)
note
  **Under Development** — Only basic Player.PvPWins
  and Player.PvPLosses counters exist.
  Detailed per-match recording and display
  is not yet implemented.
end note

start
:Player views PvP stats (planned feature);
:Read Player.PvPWins and Player.PvPLosses from GameSession;
:Display basic win/loss stats;

note
  Planned future features:
  - Detailed match history per game
  - Turn-by-turn replay
  - ELO rating tracking
  - Opponent info display
  
  Requires:
  - Match history data model
  - Repository persistence for match records
  - Dedicated MatchHistoryScreen
end note

stop
@enduml
